 5.20 1522 S3
 6.10 1645 S3
 6.50 1600 S3
 6.90 1622 S3
 7.40 1672 S3
 8.20 1672 S3
 8.80 1700 S3
 9.40 1723 S3

$ --- 4. Bevan (59Bev), visual estimate. DISCARDED by [1]
$ Three times larger than any direct measurement.
DATASET 4 Bevan estimacion visual (descartado)
 14.10 1523 S4

$ --- 5. Jacob (2000), halite miscibility gap at 1100 K
$ x_SrO = 0.240 and 0.712  ->  x(Sr) = 0.120 and 0.356 in the x(O)=0.5 cut
DATASET 5 Jacob laguna halita 1100 K
 0.120 1100 S5
 0.356 1100 S5

